1
00:00:00,546 --> 00:00:03,106
(Sheldon:)- Based on the content...
- I couldn't be less interested.

2
00:00:05,784 --> 00:00:07,714
(Howard:)Now, come on, I'll take you home.

3
00:00:07,886 --> 00:00:12,186
- Don't you want to know what's in it?
- Lf I did, I would've opened it years ago.

4
00:00:13,192 --> 00:00:15,752
(Howard:)The closet looks great.
Let's get out of here.

5
00:00:15,928 --> 00:00:19,918
(Sheldon:)Can I bring this box of extra shirt buttons
to sort on the ride?

6
00:00:21,634 --> 00:00:24,124
- Do whatever you want.
- Thanks.

7
00:00:25,137 --> 00:00:26,157
Oh!

8
00:00:26,705 --> 00:00:28,635
(Sheldon:)Great party.

9
00:00:32,311 --> 00:00:35,771
When I first met Howard, he'd pull
his scrotum out of his shorts and say:

10
00:00:35,948 --> 00:00:38,378
"Oh! I sat in gum."

11
00:00:43,422 --> 00:00:44,552
(Penny:)What is your point?

12
00:00:44,723 --> 00:00:49,383
It's kind of weird how grown up he is now.
Happily married, throwing dinner parties.

13
00:00:49,561 --> 00:00:53,721
(Penny:)Really? You couldn't just say that?
You had to tell the scrotum story?

14
00:00:55,234 --> 00:00:57,324
(Leonard:)Trying to paint a picture.

15
00:00:59,071 --> 00:01:03,301
(Penny:)It was a nice change of pace,
not eating takeout around a coffee table.

